"Xiulan shares a hidden Qi bond with Tianlan Shan, the wounded land spirit of the Azure Hills."
"A golden crack in Xiulan's chest radiates the earth's warmth and links her to Tianlan in dreams."
"When Tianlan's power surges, golden Qi and markings on her eyelids appear on Xiulan."
"Xiulan can visit Tianlan inside the land spirit's dream-like inner domain."
"Xiulan gives her Qi to Fa Ram's fields to help heal Tianlan."
"Xiulan has vowed to Tianlan to grow strong enough that no more sacrifice is needed."
"Ruolan's fire dance was made to channel Qi into the land's Dragon Veins."
"At the solstice Xiulan burned her own cultivation as kindling to restart the Dragon Vein ritual."
"Xiulan carries the will of the ancestor the Grand Ravine Sect reveres."
"Later this year, Xiulan breaks through to the Spiritual Realm at the Dueling Peaks."
